                <invention-title lang="de">STECKBARES FASEROPTISCHES MODUL ZUR THERMISCHEN VERWALTUNG UND WÄRMEABSCHIRMUNGSANORDNUNGEN, VORRICHTUNGEN UND VERFAHREN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">GESTION THERMIQUE DE MODULE DE FIBRE OPTIQUE ENFICHABLE ET ENSEMBLES, DISPOSITIFS ET PROCÉDÉS DE PROTECTION THERMIQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">PLUGGABLE OPTICAL FIBER MODULE THERMAL MANAGEMENT AND HEAT SHIELD ASSEMBLIES, DEVICES, AND METHODS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure provides a pluggable optical module (10) comprising: a housing (12) that defines a port (14) that is configured and adapted to selectively and securely receive an end portion (16) of a fiber optic connector (18); and a fiber connector detection mechanism (26) configured to automatically transition the pluggable optical module (10) from a high power state when the fiber optic connector (18) is present and engaged with the port (14) to a low power state when the fiber optic connector (18) is otherwise disengaged from the port (14), thereby limiting the housing (12) temperature when the fiber optic connector (18) is disengaged from the port (14).</p>
            </abstract>
